{"result":"{
  "metadata": {
    "id": "340099111",
    "title": "14. Email & Notification Configuration",
    "type": "page",
    "created": "",
    "updated": "",
    "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/340099111",
    "space": {
      "key": "SFCC",
      "name": "Adobe SFCC"
    },
    "version": 2,
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "Overview\n--------\n\nTransactional email configuration in BM controls the templates and service credentials for all system-generated emails — order confirmations, password resets, shipping notifications, and passwordless OTP links. Alert emails for jobs and system events must be updated away from personal or contractor email addresses before the architect leaves.\n\n**📎 Salesforce Docs:** [Email Templates in Business Manager](https://documentation.b2c.commercecloud.salesforce.com/DOC2/topic/com.demandware.dochelp/Email/EmailTemplates.html)  \n**📎 Salesforce Docs:** [Configuring Email Services](https://documentation.b2c.commercecloud.salesforce.com/DOC2/topic/com.demandware.dochelp/Email/EmailConfiguration.html)  \n**📎 Emarsys Docs:** [Emarsys SFCC Integration](https://help.emarsys.com/hc/en-us/categories/360003482893-Salesforce-Commerce-Cloud)\n\n**⚠️ Risk note:** Passwordless OTP login requires the OTP email template to be configured and the email service to be operational. If the email service credentials are wrong, OTP login silently fails for all users attempting passwordless login.\n\n---\n\nChecklist\n---------\n\n### Email Service Configuration\n\nincompleteEmail service (SMTP or API-based) configured in BM with **production** credentials\nincompleteEmail service is **not** pointing at a test/sandbox Emarsys environment\nincompleteFrom address configured correctly per site (no \"test@\" or placeholder addresses)\nincompleteEmail sending tested from each site\n\n### Transactional Email Templates\n\nincomplete**Order confirmation** email template configured and rendering correctly\nincomplete**Shipping confirmation** email template configured\nincomplete**Password reset** email template configured — critical for SLAS registered login flow\nincomplete**Passwordless OTP** email template configured — required for passwordless login\nincomplete**Account creation confirmation** email template configured\nincomplete**Back in stock / Notify Me** email template configured (if Notify Me feature is in scope)\n\n### Emarsys Integration\n\nincompleteEmarsys SFCC cartridge configured with production credentials\nincompleteOrder data flowing from SFCC to Emarsys (for post-purchase flows)\nincompleteCustomer registration event firing to Emarsys\nincompleteEmail suppression / unsubscribe logic working correctly\n\n### System Alert Emails\n\nincompleteJob failure notification email recipients updated — **must not be the departing architect's personal email**\nincompleteJob alerts routed to a team distribution list or shared inbox\nincompleteBM administration alert emails updated\nincompleteAny webhook or monitoring alert emails updated\n\n### Per-Site Verification\n\nincompleteAU — order confirmation email sent and rendering correctly\nincompleteUK — order confirmation email sent and rendering correctly\nincompleteUS Domestic — order confirmation email sent and rendering correctly\nincompleteEU Domestic — order confirmation email sent and rendering correctly (check EU locale / language)\n\n\n---\n\nNotes / Findings\n----------------\n\n*Record gaps, decisions, and owner for remediation here.*\n\n| Finding | Severity | Owner | Resolved |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  |  |  |",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
    "emoji": "1f4e7",
    "page_width": "full-width"
  }
}"}

{"result":"{
  "metadata": {
    "id": "261849101",
    "title": "1.4 Third Party Overview",
    "type": "page",
    "created": "",
    "updated": "",
    "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/261849101",
    "space": {
      "key": "SFCC",
      "name": "Adobe SFCC"
    },
    "version": 4,
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "Backend & Integration\n---------------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| MuleSoft | Middleware that brokers all SFCC ↔ New Store (OMS) / AP21 (Product Feed) / Omneo (CRM, Loyalty) / Narvar (Tracking); SFCC never calls the backends directly |\n| AP21 (ERP) | Product and pricing master data, composition/material attributes, HS codes, and Retail Rewards balances |\n| NewStore (OMS) | Order creation, fulfilment, dispatch, BOPIS, and the system of record for order history |\n| Omneo (CRM & loyalty) | Customer identity, loyalty and CRM system of record; bidirectional sync plus an iFrame in My Account for Communication Preferences |\n| Emarsys | Marketing and transactional email, fed downstream from Omneo |\n\nPayments & Checkout\n-------------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| Adyen | Domestic payment capture - card, 3DS, tokenisation (Drop-In) |\n| PayPal | Wallet payment, offered through Adyen |\n| Apple Pay / Google Pay | Wallet payments via Adyen |\n| Klarna | Buy-now-pay-later on AU and US via Adyen |\n| GiveX | Gift card and credit-note issue, validate, redeem, refund and balance check |\n| Global-e | Owns international checkout, payment, duties and tax; provides the nightly FX/pricebook feed |\n| Avalara | Tax calculation for US domestic, New Zealand and New Caledonia. |\n\nContent & Media\n---------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| Contentful | Headless CMS for all editorial content and imagery |\n| Vimeo | Hosts product video *(platform choice still open)* |\n| TransPerfect | Translation pipeline for Contentful content |\n\nDiscovery & Engagement\n----------------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| Salesforce Einstein | Search, merchandising and product recommendations (Salesforce-native) |\n| Narvar | Estimated delivery dates, tracking, returns and order/shipping emails (domestic only) |\n| Inside Chat | Live chat / support widget, loaded via GTM post-consent |\n| Booxi | Boutique appointment history in My Account *(scope TBC)* |\n| Measmerize | Size recommendation widget and size guide on the PDP |\n\nLocation & Address\n------------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| Google Places | Address autocomplete and validation at checkout and in My Account |\n| Google Maps | Store locator and Find-in-Boutique mapping |\n| Google Business API | Daily feed of boutique opening hours |\n\nAnalytics, Consent & Experimentation\n------------------------------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| Didomi | Consent management platform; gates all third-party scripts |\n| Google Tag Manager | Tag orchestration and data-layer consumption (hosted via AddingWell) |\n| Google Analytics 4 | Web analytics, loaded through GTM |\n| AddingWell | First-party / server-side tagging server hosting the GTM container |\n| Optimizely Web | A/B testing and experimentation (US storefront only) |\n| Crazy Egg | Heatmapping and session replay |\n\nFeeds, Fulfilment & Security\n----------------------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| Feedonomics | Product feed to downstream marketing channels |\n| Lengow | Product feed to downstream marketing channels |\n| Google reCAPTCHA | Bot protection on registration and login (consent-gated in EU & UK) |",
      "format": "markdown"
    }
  }
}"}

